        "Content": "RAY COOKE LETTINGS ADVERTISE PROPERTIES ON FACEBOOK & INSTAGRAM FIRST SO PLEASE MAKE SURE YOU ARE FOLLOWING US THERE VIDEO VIEWINGS AVAILABLE ON REQUEST\n\n\nTHREE BEDROOM APARTMENT IN DUBLIN 5\n\n\nRay Cooke Lettings are thrilled to present this immaculate three-bedroom apartment in the highly sought-after Watermill development, Raheny, Dublin 5. This stunning property is presented in pristine condition throughout and offers bright, spacious and modern living in an unbeatable coastal location.\n\nUpon entering, you are greeted by a large entrance hallway with excellent storage. The hallway leads to a main bathroom, followed by an open-plan living and dining area with a fully fitted kitchen. From here, balcony access provides a superb outdoor space ideal for relaxing or entertaining. The apartment also includes three bedrooms, one of which features a private ensuite, along with a separate utility room for added convenience. The property further benefits from gas-fired central heating.\n\nLocated just off Watermill Road, this exceptional apartment is within walking distance of Dollymount Beach, St. Anne's Park, and Raheny Village. The area offers an excellent range of amenities including schools, shops, cafés, restaurants, and a local library. Transport links are outstanding, with Raheny DART Station, multiple bus routes, and easy access to Eastpoint Business Park, the IFSC, and the Docklands.\n\nKey Features:\n<ul>\n <li>Large bedrooms</li>\n <li>Excellent amenities nearby</li>\n <li>Quiet peaceful development</li>\n <li>Plenty of storage space</li>\n <li>LOCATION, LOCATION, LOCATION!</li>\n</ul>\n\n\nRAY COOKE LETTINGS PREFER EMAIL ENQUIRES AS ITS EASIER TO MANAGE, PLEASE FILL IN YOUR CONTACT INFORMATION ON THE RIGHT HANDSIDE AND CLICK THE SEND MESSAGE, WE WILL CONTACT YOU WITH VIEWING DETAILS WHEN THEY ARISE"
      },
